# Language statistics
#
# Only tools/ is first-party source. Everything under EFI/ and vendor/ is
# redistributed upstream work, and profiles/ is generated by tools/extract.py,
# so none of it should count towards what this repository is written in. The
# ASL that used to show up came from a .dsl inside a bundled Acidanthera kext.
EFI/**       linguist-vendored
vendor/**    linguist-vendored
profiles/**  linguist-generated

# Never diff or merge these as text
*.efi   binary
*.aml   binary
*.icns  binary
*.lbl   binary
*.l2x   binary
*.bin   binary
*.zip   binary
*.png   binary
*.mp3   binary
*.wav   binary
